# Ruleset: HTTP DNS
#
# Expects a reject policy.
#
# Stops mainland apps from bypassing the gateway resolver. Hang this on a policy that can be switched off rather than a hard REJECT. If an app fails closed instead of falling back, that host belongs in Rescue.
#
# DNSPod's public DoH under doh.pub and dns.pub is the same bypass with a general resolver behind it: 227 flows from six devices in the 14 days to 2026-11-02, matched direct by GEOIP. The foreign public resolvers are in Proxy/DoH.list.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,httpdns.platform.dbankcloud.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,httpdns.platform.dbankcloud.com
DOMAIN,dns.pub
DOMAIN,dns.wechat.com
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com.cn
DOMAIN,doh.pub
DOMAIN,httpdns.alicdn.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.aliyuncs.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.baidu.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.baidubce.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.bilivideo.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.huaweicloud.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.meituan.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.music.163.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.n.netease.com
DOMAIN,httpdns.volcengineapi.com
